+        //
+        // The tile rect is already in output units (`bg_size`), and the tile
+        // offsets are applied in output space, so both the culling bbox and the
+        // stride are scaled by `base_transform` only. `viewport` maps the SVG
+        // source into the tile and must not be applied twice.
